sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Dashboard
    participant O as Orchestrator
    participant F as Firmware
    participant B as Bootloader
    participant FL as flash.bin

    U->>O: POST /ota {version, mode}
    O->>O: version preflight
    O->>F: ota_update {version, mode}
    F->>O: GET /ota/{version}/download
    F->>FL: write staging
    F->>B: execv bootloader
    B->>FL: verify Ed25519 + AES-GCM + anti-downgrade

    alt valid and newer
        B->>FL: write inactive slot
        B->>F: boot new slot (pending)
        F->>FL: confirm after ~3 s
    else rejected or downgrade
        B->>F: boot current slot
    end

    U->>O: poll health (version + slot)
